    "metadata": {
      "description": "Hey hey, it's a second helping of Nick's short interview series from Midwest Gaming Classic 2026. This is Part 2 of a 2 part series.Adam Lewis Graf is a host of the Pocketeering podcast, and creator of Gumball in Trick-or-Treat Land for the GameBoy Color. Find it online at Itch.io or Steam, or get a physical cartridge from Mega Cat Studios.Artix von Krieger (Adam Bohn) is the founder and CEO of Artix Entertainment. Find him online at Artix.com. Besides Dungeons and Doomknights, Artix is the developer of several other NESmaker projects, most of which you can check out here.All music breaks in this episode are courtesy of Jordan Davis (aka Raftronaut). Find his work at Raft Labs Interactive. Want to support the podcast? We have a new Ko-Fi link at our website, homebrewgameclub.com, where you can also find links to previous episodes, social media, and more.Chapters:(00:00:00) Intro(00:01:22) Music 1: Viper's Last Drag(00:02:22) Adam Graff(00:16:21) Music 2: Winter Camping(00:17:02) Artix Krieger(00:36:10) Outro",
